2. **Daily Consumption**: Emily eats 9 pieces of candy each day.

3. **Duration of Candy**: To determine how long the candy will last, we divide the total number of candies by the number eaten per day:
   $$
   18 \div 9 = 2
   $$

   This means Emily will eat all 18 pieces of candy in **2 days**.

