Initially, there are 4 players. Then 5 more players join.  
$$
4 + 5 = 9 \text{ players}
$$

---

### Step 2: Calculate the total number of lives
Each player has 3 lives. So, we multiply the total number of players by the number of lives each has:
$$
9 \times 3 = 27
$$

---

